 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/10/22 20:12| 02 | 017| 012| 0483| 0145| 0313| 0738|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/10/22 14:36| 02 | 204| 014| 0396| 0320| 0116| 0946|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/10/22 12:36| 01 | 204| 014| 0138| 0368| 0114| 1046|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/10/22 11:12| 02 | 348| 014| 0415| 0055| 0334| 0512|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/10/22 08:24| 02 | 209| 024| 0274| 0126| 0116| 0578|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/10/22 08:12| 01 | 212| 014| 022"
